Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.84,0:00:02.98,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,What are you guys plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:08.94,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,According to Knight, you promised \Nto save both Lili and their mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:11.63,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But you only saved Lili...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:14.45,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,So why is Knight fine with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.45,0:00:18.82,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,As the first person to be taken hostage, \Ntheir mother is most likely dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:22.67,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That's only your assumption!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:26.88,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Either way, that can be solved \Nby using the Resurrection Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:29.29,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Is that what you told Knight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.29,0:00:32.14,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,So he thinks he'll see his mom again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:38.06,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, I proved to him \Nit was possible by killing him once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:39.24,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:43.15,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,How were you sure the Resurrection \NRight even existed at that point?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.15,0:00:45.45,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I wasn't, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:47.07,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It wouldn't have mattered either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:48.61,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That's messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:49.82,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Raion-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:51.86,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Sudo-kun is the brains behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:53.83,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We'll win in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.83,0:00:55.99,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It'd be wise to have faith in Sudo-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.99,0:00:57.95,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,if you're really as clever as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:14.51,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:30.04,Default,Male 1,0,0,0,,Found him! There!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:31.63,Default,Male 2,0,0,0,,Hey, Kai Kasai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:34.63,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh... The two goofs from this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:36.66,Default,Male 2,0,0,0,,You've really got some nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.66,0:02:38.23,Default,Male 2,0,0,0,,We hired that guy you introduced us to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:41.10,Default,Male 2,0,0,0,,because he was supposed to be \Nsome powerful Prime Right owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:43.73,Default,Male 2,0,0,0,,He got killed just like that \Nby some random bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:46.45,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Not another complaint...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:48.98,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,I'm over here introducing people \Nout of my own good will,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.94,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,all because you guys are so desperate \Nto survive the Killer Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:55.57,Default,Male 1,0,0,0,,My Prime Right disappeared \Nimmediately after that guy died!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.19,Default,Male 1,0,0,0,,You set us up, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.70,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs35\pos(320,20)}Mortgage Right
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.70,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,My Prime Right is the Mortgage Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:03.95,OS,Sign,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord1.5\3c&H2B312B&\c&HF2F8F3&\3a&H42&}Agreement
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:04.33,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,If someone breaks an agreement \Nthey made with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:06.71,OS,Sign,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord1.5\3c&H2B312B&\c&HF2F8F3&\3a&H42&\pos(429,11)}Contract Breach
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:06.71,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,I gain whatever I designate as the guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:05.46,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(379,144)\fs15\c&H6D706D&}Guarantee
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:06.71,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\c&H6D706D&\pos(78,142)}Guarantee
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:09.15,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,In your case, I set up our contract
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:12.61,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,so that any injuries to the guy I introduced \Nwould be a breach of contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:14.38,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,What was your Prime Right again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:18.89,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,The ability to construct buildings \Nanywhere on land you don't own?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.31,0:03:21.35,Default,Male 1,0,0,0,,R-Run...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:23.73,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Production Attribute...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:24.85,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Superficies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:30.86,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,This could actually come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:33.05,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,That was awesome, Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:34.37,Default,Woman,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:36.20,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Shooting Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:41.66,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Blast Raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:47.62,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Huh... I guess I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:51.63,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The Imitation Right can recreate \Nattacks from games, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:53.59,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Lucky I got a hold of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:56.13,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,This Prime Right was made for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:57.88,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}A kid?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:02.97,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Hello to those of you within \Na one-kilometer radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.11,0:04:07.52,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,{\i1}T-The Emperor?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:10.48,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i0}We will now begin tallying the majority.{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:14.70,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i0}"I own multiple Prime Rights." Yes or No?{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:14.69,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,50)}I own multiple Prime Rights
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:21.62,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Now... Have you figured out what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:23.47,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,No need to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:25.14,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,This is a negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:26.98,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I could use someone like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:31.58,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'll make you my deputy officer if you can \Naccept the conditions I'm about to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.97,0:04:33.58,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,R-Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:37.36,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Obey my every command, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.68,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Give your life to see them through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:42.47,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You can be revived \Nas many times as necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:44.65,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Betray me and you'll be killed instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:48.01,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll be taking \Nall of your Prime Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.39,0:04:49.77,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,I-I swear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.05,0:04:51.77,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Negotiation complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:54.43,Italics,Emperor,0,0,0,,The Negotiation Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:56.78,Italics,Emperor,0,0,0,,I was right to ask for this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:05:01.53,Comp very big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,35)\fad(1,500)}Tasuketsu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:05:00.18,Italics,Emperor,0,0,0,,Sis combined her Rights so I could take tally
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:04.45,Italics,Emperor,0,0,0,,and conduct Tasuketsu whenever \NI want up to two more times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:07.70,Italics,Emperor,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll keep hunting Right owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:28.27,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,1)\c&HFFF1EC&\move(530,77,530,-54)}Rear
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:13.87,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,For now, our team is structured \Nwith our central members
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:17.71,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,of Gobo and Sudo in the \Nrear with four guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.05,0:05:36.77,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,1)\c&HFFF1EC&\move(520,213,520,80)}Middle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:20.75,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,In the middle is Shinozaki, \Nwho will gather information,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:25.74,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,along with three members with enough \Nfirepower and flexibility to move around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:28.28,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Those being Ippy-hiko, Eren-chan, and Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:36.77,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,1)\c&HFFF1EC&\move(525,295,525,235)}Front
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:32.10,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,And I'll be the main striker at the front \Nwith Raion as our second brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:34.26,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,and Nishime for support.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:36.42,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,We're still heavy on defense...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:41.94,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,It can't be helped. We gotta watch out \Nfor both the Queen and other civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:46.90,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,A boy with eyes of the Emperor's emblem\N has been spotted in eastern Adachi Ward!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:48.04,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:51.04,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:52.54,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}This isn't good...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:56.63,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before, the Emperor could only \Nkill people through Tasuketsu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:05:58.05,Comp very big-an8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(323,106)\c&HF7FFFD&\b0}Man or Woman
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:06:01.13,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he's resolved that weakness \Nand now works on the front line...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:05:59.47,Comp very big-an8,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FFFD&\pos(320,41)\b0\fs24}You are currently looking at this\Nscreen in Tokyo Prefecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.13,Comp big-an8,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FFFD&\b0\fs20\pos(322,60)}A question for those within the 210th floor of the Emperor's tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.13,Comp big-an8,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FFFD&\b0\pos(322,250)}Are you part of Team Saneatsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:07.11,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Killer Game's main objective is to \Nrecover Rights and strengthen the Emperor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:10.47,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}At this rate, our chances of winning \Nwill dwindle as time goes on.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:12.55,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Well this is troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.55,0:06:13.73,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:19.34,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if we traced him, we can't identify their \Nheadquarters given the Concealment Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:23.80,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, the Emperor is too strong. \NWe have to avoid direct battle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:27.88,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}But idly waiting it out won't give us \Nany advantages in the long run...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:30.06,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}In fact, it would end horribly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:31.70,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then our only shot is to...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:35.21,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Nihonyanagi, return home immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:36.80,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I'll have someone come get you just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:38.33,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Meet up with them on your way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:39.46,Italics,Nishime,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.67,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Ouno, Ichinose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:43.33,Italics,Sudo,0,0,0,,You two head to the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:47.58,Italics,Emperor,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:50.35,Italics,Emperor,0,0,0,,I don't see any potential prey out here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:52.50,Italics,Emperor,0,0,0,,Maybe I should head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:55.69,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You're the Emperor, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:06:59.15,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:01.58,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:06.36,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm Raion Ouno. My father was \NHyogo Ouno, an auditor for the Camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.93,0:07:08.32,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The Camp?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.69,Italics,Raion,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:12.32,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:14.91,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Come on, don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:18.33,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the facility \Nthe Emperor was born in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:23.04,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The giant circular facility built 100 meters \Nunderground at the border of Tokyo and Chiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:25.01,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,They abducted people and\N experimented on them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:27.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,to facilitate the obtainment of the Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:31.85,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,How did you find me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:34.22,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You held a tally just a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:37.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,It was a close call. Had the scope \Nbeen a bit larger, I'd be a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:40.99,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I figured seeing you was some kind of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.99,0:07:42.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You see, I wanted to apologize...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.83,0:07:44.86,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:46.83,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,For the inhumane treatment you suffered
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:50.30,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,at the hands of people \Nat the Camp, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:53.04,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}This kid's got some balls...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:56.29,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't expect him to start \Nbluffing to his face.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:58.52,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the Emperor we're dealing with!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:04.36,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That apology might be odd coming \Nfrom another victim, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:07.10,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,It was my own family's doing, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:07.97,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:11.13,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I was almost another one \Nof their guinea pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:14.35,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But I was saved thanks to \Na dispute among the higher ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:19.23,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't imagine a normal citizen \Napproaching the Emperor by choice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:21.59,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's either actually from the Camp,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:25.36,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}or he could be working with \Nthat group who killed me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:29.22,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Maybe I should mention some information \Nthat only core members knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.22,0:08:33.66,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,There are 666 Rights total! How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:35.73,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:38.03,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}This guy has classified \Ninformation on the Camp!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.71,0:08:41.94,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}He must really be a son \Nof the Camp's auditor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:45.56,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who knows if he's trustworthy, \Nbut he's definitely legit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:48.60,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Looks like it actually worked.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:50.71,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Didn't take much.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:54.97,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you find any solace in others \Nwho suffered the same fate as you,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.06,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm gonna exploit that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:09:01.52,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Fine... I'll trust you \Nif you agree to negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:03.66,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Negotiation Right...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:05.48,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I figured that'd be your next play.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.53,0:09:09.20,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Only if the conditions are up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.82,0:09:11.03,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:17.45,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Promise that you won't do anything \Nto put me in harm's way from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:20.41,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,That's pretty demanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:23.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,In return, I'll join your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.59,0:09:25.09,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I won't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:27.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,And I'll promise never to betray you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.15,0:09:30.84,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Fine, negotiation complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:37.06,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a dope... I never said anything \Nabout negotiating with you, Emperor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:41.20,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe you should pay attention \Nto where people are pointing{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:43.67,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}before finalizing your negotiations.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:50.24,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, the Emperor can't hurt me \Nin return for my loyalty... to Ryuta!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:53.68,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}People can lie with more \Nthan just words, you know.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:56.99,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Total immunity from \Nthe Emperor's attacks at no risk...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:58.37,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks, chump!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:58.99,Show Title,Raion,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.50,0:10:03.64,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Now. What to do next...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:07.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I've actually infiltrated \Nthe current Emperor's team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:08.21,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.21,0:10:10.44,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,That's good to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:12.92,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,How much information \Nhave you gathered so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.21,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Nothing major, just the basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:18.39,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,It's a mix of newbies and veterans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:25.25,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But the core veterans are withholding any \Ninformation unrelated to the tasks at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:26.65,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:30.30,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm confident I could kill them off \Nnow if I wanted to, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:33.64,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}They got me once before \Nbecause I let my guard down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:35.81,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Here's what we'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.81,0:10:38.66,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You come back to headquarters with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:44.72,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,There, you can tell us about \Nthe fake Emperor and their team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:48.67,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Afterwards, you go back to their headquarters \Nand continue infiltrating them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.61,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,So I'll be your spy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.61,0:10:53.84,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Okay, you better protect me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:57.18,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You're the only one I trust right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:59.54,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.54,0:11:02.81,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I can't say I fully trust \Nthe Queen's servants, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:04.77,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Aren't you on their team, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:07.59,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I've always worked alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:12.24,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,My servant puppets were destroyed, \Nso the only ones I trust now are the Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:14.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,and the civilian I picked up a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:17.98,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Gotcha. Then, do you mind \Nif I come back again later?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.48,0:11:19.55,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.55,0:11:22.58,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,We have curfews every time we go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:24.41,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,They may get suspicious \Nif I don't get back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:25.88,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:28.18,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Then come back here again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:29.33,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'll come get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:30.49,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:32.96,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'll be here around 23:30. Does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:34.47,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:37.04,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'll tell the Queen our plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:59.62,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hey. Glad you kept up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.78,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,It's not as easy without a plan in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:04.29,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The subway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:07.08,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not like the trains are running.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:09.17,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Let's walk the tracks back home just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:13.19,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,But man, that was some work \Nyou did back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:16.48,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The Emperor won't be able \Nto attack you at all now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:20.09,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,and you've been invited into enemy \Nquarters with his full support.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:22.55,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Doesn't change the fact that it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.07,0:12:25.52,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I bet we're really close to winning now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:27.58,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I hope so, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.39,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Who knows how the Queen will respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:32.48,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Jeez, your Fusion Right sure is useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:33.94,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.71,0:12:38.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hey, Ryuta...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:40.90,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I know, we're on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:44.19,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,He's the one who pushed humanity \Nto the brink of extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.19,0:12:46.41,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,And the one who killed Sane and Saaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:47.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:50.67,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,He's the one who killed Kazuki, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.07,0:12:53.13,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Don't be reckless, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:54.53,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:56.79,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'll keep my feelings hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.09,0:13:04.75,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'll go in unarmed, without \Nany receivers or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.75,0:13:07.56,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Beyond that, let's just hope \Nthe Emperor protects me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:10.39,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Why are you going at 23:30?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:15.82,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'll keep the Emperor busy to prevent \NTasuketsu from happening at 23:55.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:17.43,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:18.82,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Good thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:21.09,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we have someone follow him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:22.46,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:24.45,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'll watch over him \Nwith my Visualization Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:28.03,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,As long as I'm alive, I promise \Nto be back tomorrow before noon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.03,0:13:29.37,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,so wait for me through the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:32.44,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Obviously, you'll know \Nmy fate if I'm not back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.44,0:13:34.88,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,But If I were to come back after noon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.18,0:13:38.63,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Don't hold your breath. Assume \Nit's someone else and kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:40.68,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I admire your conviction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:42.63,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Raion-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:45.28,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Like you told me before,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:48.81,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,to maintain the upper hand, \Nwe'll have to bluff a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:58.72,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like I thought. We're transporting \Nwith the Exchange Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:00.93,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm glad we didn't have anyone follow us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:03.24,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,All right. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.49,0:14:07.08,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Shinozaki here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:09.57,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Confirming transportation \Nwith the Exchange Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:13.29,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,My Presentation Right went dark, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:15.63,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,They must have entered the concealed area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.97,0:14:18.58,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}You got this, Raion.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:24.72,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}So she's... Queen Kisaragi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.93,0:14:27.39,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's Kou Kirishima and...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.39,0:14:28.85,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seraphiel.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:31.81,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,You must be Raion Ouno.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.20,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:34.67,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Like I told you this afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:37.80,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,we've already established his loyalty \Nwith my Negotiation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:39.40,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:41.73,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Huh? Sis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.73,0:14:43.44,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Did I forget to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:44.86,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:47.60,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:51.54,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}That makes the Emperor \Nanother cousin of Yagihashi's.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:54.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell's going on with that family?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:56.54,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:15:00.63,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,So you're the one who \Nchallenged me to a bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:04.07,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I didn't think you were \Non the Emperor's side, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:06.59,Default,Queen,0,0,0,,You know Tojuro Yagihashi, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:11.77,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah... But he's been a hard guy to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:16.51,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,So we've got the Fusion Right, \NRejection Right, Materialization Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:20.01,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Response Right, Suspension Right, \Nand the Presentation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.43,0:15:24.36,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Man, Raion. They only \Ntold you about six Rights?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:28.09,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll try to get as many as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:29.20,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.23,0:15:32.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Where's the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:35.14,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Outside and in the building to your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.14,0:15:36.99,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:42.09,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right, now what?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.52,0:15:45.74,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't have much time.\NI gotta get to the point.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:50.36,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Who do we have here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:51.93,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:55.31,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,No worries, it's just space division.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:58.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Division... The Division Right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:15:59.77,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}This guy must be Ren Iruga!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:02.49,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Judging from your reaction... \NYou must be Raion-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:04.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Wait! How do you know who I—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:08.24,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I have a bit of a connection \Nwith the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.24,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,With Yagihashi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:15.02,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Pres predicted you'd eventually \Ncome here a long, long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:18.37,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,He seems to trust your lying quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:20.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.19,0:16:24.50,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yagihashi actually depends on my lies?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.03,0:16:29.01,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}What he said were actually instructions \Nknowing I could win over the Emperor?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:34.87,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yagihashi... Iruga... And given those \Ninstructions, Sudo must be involved, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.48,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a brutal trio... Jeez.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:39.25,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:52.09,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Iruga, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:55.45,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Ebina! And Hirayama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:16:59.94,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I've heard the gist \Nabout you guys from Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:02.71,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I don't have much time, so let's be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:07.09,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Right. We want you guys to take down \Nthe Emperor and Seraphiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:09.39,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Are we gonna split up and fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.39,0:17:12.55,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Lady Kisaragi and Kou are usually together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:14.96,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Besides, you guys are more \Nfamiliar with the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:18.06,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,and we're more familiar \Nwith Lady Kisaragi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:20.52,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,What about the other guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:23.26,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, \Nbut our hands are too full.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:25.36,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,We have to ask your side \Nto take care of the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.72,0:17:27.82,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,We'll have a backup plan, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:31.31,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,Once we've gathered enough information, \Nwe'll plan for Hikari's escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:35.82,Default,Hirayama,0,0,0,,No matter what, we'll make sure \Nthat information gets to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:37.70,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That's enough for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.70,0:17:39.85,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,Knight better be safe over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:42.22,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Don't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:45.04,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,He's running around our \Nheadquarters safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:48.51,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Hey, Raion! You still in there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.51,0:17:50.20,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Damn it! It's the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:51.92,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Now, now, no need to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:53.83,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,We're in a whole other space.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.83,0:17:56.21,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I'll let you out on your own, Raion-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:04.81,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:09.73,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,U-Um, I couldn't find the bathroom \Nso I went outside. My bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.31,0:18:17.64,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,You're not as sharp as I thought, Raion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:20.84,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you get back pretty soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:21.70,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'll take you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:24.65,Default-Top,Emperor,0,0,0,,It'll be a quick jump \Nwith Meguru's Prime Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.21,0:18:25.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The innocent way he laughed just now...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:27.37,Default-Top,Emperor,0,0,0,,You know, that power really comes in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:31.09,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The reason he's friendly towards me isn't \Njust because he used the Negotiation Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:31.09,Default-Top,Emperor,0,0,0,,Besides, who doesn't dream \Nabout teleporting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:36.09,Default-Top,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's like, we can do anything you see \Nin manga and games with Prime Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:36.09,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}He thinks of me as a friend \Naround the same age as him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:38.66,Default-Top,Emperor,0,0,0,,Kinda like I did with Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:39.94,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}They said he suffered all alone all that time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:41.67,Default-Top,Emperor,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I have another Right \Ncalled the Imitation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:44.10,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does this mean he's sincerely \Nhappy to have me here?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:45.75,Default-Top,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's awesome, I can even recreate \Nattacks from games and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:47.11,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it... Why?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:47.11,Default-Top,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'll show you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.94,0:18:51.61,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Emperor killed Kazuki...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:55.17,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}And billions of other people...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:56.53,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}So then why...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:18:59.73,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why does my heart sting like this?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.85,0:19:05.42,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Confirming return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:07.86,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Welcome back, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:10.63,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Glad to see you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:13.01,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.01,0:19:14.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Should I share my report tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:17.59,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,No, let's go over the main points now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:19.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The infiltration was successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:20.91,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I met the Queen and them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:24.77,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Along with a few others, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:28.90,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Any details you can share with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:30.82,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Internal information or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.82,0:19:34.44,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah... To start, there was \Nanother head to count.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:36.85,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,His name was Kai Kasai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.85,0:19:39.11,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,He's a new officer to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.11,0:19:43.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,He has the ability to steal others' Rights \Nif they break agreements with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.38,0:19:44.91,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,It's called the Mortgage Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.91,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Sounds pretty powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:48.14,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.97,0:19:51.84,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I met with Hirayama and Hikari, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:54.35,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Knight's story was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.93,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hirayama's side will take down \Nthe Queen and Kou.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:03.10,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,He wants us to deal with \Nthe Emperor and Seraphiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:06.84,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Hmm... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.84,0:20:08.74,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,That's not going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:12.03,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Which reminds me, Yagihashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.03,0:20:15.22,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You know the Emperor's real name, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.55,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It'd be misleading to say \NI "know" him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:21.74,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,By that, I'm guessing it's Haruto-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:25.70,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,How does the President know the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:30.57,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The Emperor Haruto Yanagi is \Nthe Queen Maria Kisaragi's little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.57,0:20:33.17,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Which means he's Yagihashi's cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.07,0:20:37.15,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,The Queen and Emperor are siblings?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:39.01,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,{\i1}And{\i0} they're both cousins of Pres?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.53,0:20:42.79,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I wasn't aware of that fact, \Nbut it sounds like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.43,0:20:48.72,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,But more importantly, who was closer \Nto the Queen, Kou or Seraphiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:50.40,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Did he say "more importantly"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:51.88,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Kou was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:57.28,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,That's why Hirayama decided to take the two \Nof them and asked us to deal with Seraphiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.61,0:21:01.28,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I see. I understand very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:05.16,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Raion-kun, your efforts \Nsurpassed my expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:09.83,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}He sure looks satisfied.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.26,0:21:14.88,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}So he used me to sniff out \Ninformation he was looking for.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:17.01,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,{\i1}This connects...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:20.01,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,Innocence
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:20.01,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,{\i1}every piece of the puzzle.{\i0}
